  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Force <em>F </em>acts on an object during time <em>t</em>. The variation of <em>F</em> with <em>t</em> is shown on the graph below. At <em>t</em> = 0, the object has a speed of 15 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> and at <em>t</em> = 20 ms it has a speed of 20 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the mass of the object?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{5}\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{5}\"></span> kg</li>\n</ol>"
